>>
Rule 1 (tensor must be 1D)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1
>>
Rule 4 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (input tensors must have the same number of elements)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 8 (tensor should not contain zero elements)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 9 (input tensors must have the same number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
